+# Offline mirror of the Code on the Go add-ons gallery (plugins, templates,
+# snippets, code-actions). Sibling of the 'code' role: a static site served by
+# NGINX, no daemon, no database. The gallery is browsed at http://box/code-addons
+# and each add-on downloads from http://box/code-addons/dl/<slug>.cgp.
+# Design: controller/docs/ADR-addons-offline-gallery.md (K2GO-99).
+
+# The published gallery to mirror from (the public R2 site). The role follows
+# references from index.html and v1/catalog.json, so it needs no file list: a new
+# add-on or a new shell asset is picked up on the next (re)install.
+# TO UPDATE a deployed box without a re-bake, dash-node re-runs the same mirror
+# in-server; a re-bake or 'runrole --reinstall code_addons' re-mirrors here.
